# EverDeliver — Java / Spring conventions

- Multi-module Gradle: `everdeliver-api`, `everdeliver-worker`, `everdeliver-common`. Prefer extending these over new top-level apps unless SPEC/ADR says otherwise.
- API enqueues; workers deliver to providers. Do not call SendGrid/Twilio from the dashboard frontend.
- Shared DTOs live in `everdeliver-common`.
- Config via `application.yml` + env overrides (Compose). Document new env vars in `docs/LOCAL_SETUP.md`.
- Match existing style: Lombok where already used, constructor injection, simple REST controllers.
- Before adding dependencies (JPA, Twilio SDK, SendGrid SDK), confirm via SPEC architecture checklist / ADR.
